cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in your research, please cite it."
title: "PTMS: Parallel Tournament Merge Sort"
abstract: >
  Parallel merge sort with a three-tier pipeline (tournament merge,
  parallel merge, SIMD base cases). Outperforms tbb::parallel_sort
  by ~2x on cache-resident data.
authors:
  - family-names: "Afimov"
    given-names: "Andrey"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2025-01-01"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/TylerBurger777/PTMS"
keywords:
  - sorting
  - parallel
  - openmp
  - simd
  - avx2
  - avx-512
  - merge-sort
